    <Fluffy.BackupPower.RunOnBatteriesOnly.Label>仅靠电池运行</Fluffy.BackupPower.RunOnBatteriesOnly.Label>
    <Fluffy.BackupPower.RunOnBatteriesOnly.Desc>启用后，当电池电量足够满时，备用电源控制单元将关闭。
禁用后，备用电源控制单元只在电池电量足够满且当前发电量超过需求时才关闭。</Fluffy.BackupPower.RunOnBatteriesOnly.Desc>

