    <Fluffy.BackupPower.ForceFlickOff.Label>DEV: 强制关闭</Fluffy.BackupPower.ForceFlickOff.Label>
    <Fluffy.BackupPower.ForceFlickOff.Desc>DEV: 无论当前电力状况如何，强制关闭发电机。</Fluffy.BackupPower.ForceFlickOff.Desc>
    <Fluffy.BackupPower.ForceFlickOn.Label>DEV: 强制开启</Fluffy.BackupPower.ForceFlickOn.Label>
    <Fluffy.BackupPower.ForceFlickOn.Desc>DEV: 无论当前电力状况如何，强制开启发电机。</Fluffy.BackupPower.ForceFlickOn.Desc>

